OL,3,GNEWSAMusic sessions for children with
OL,4,Aadditional needs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new music initiative designed to
OL,7,Fsupport pupils with additional learning
OL,8,Fneeds has been launched in Guernsey.
OL,10,FPupils from Le Rondin School will take
OL,11,Fpart in the programme, called Music
OL,12,FMakers, which has been launched by the
OL,13,FGuernsey Youth Commission and Guernsey
OL,14,FMusic Centre with sponsorship from law
OL,15,Ffirm Collas Crill.
OL,17,FOrganisers said it had been tailored
OL,18,Ffor children with neurodiversity,
OL,19,Fphysical disabilities and communication
OL,20,Fdifferences in an inclusive
OL,21,Fenvironment.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
