OL,3,GNEWSAMusic sessions for children with
OL,4,Aadditional needs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe youth commission's chief executive,
OL,7,FLou Leale, said music could help
OL,8,Fchildren with additional learning needs
OL,9,Fexpress themselves, develop confidence
OL,10,Fand build social connections.
